---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description:
		"CV of Jose Barbosa - Engineering Director with 15+ years scaling engineering teams and high-traffic systems across Southeast Asia and Latin America.",
	title: "CV",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<div class="mb-4 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 print:hidden">
		<h1 class="title text-3xl sm:text-4xl">CV</h1>
		<button
			class="text-muted hover:text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase"
			id="print-cv"
			type="button"
		>
			Print / Save PDF
		</button>
	</div>
	<p class="text-muted mb-12 print:hidden">
		Engineering Director, 15+ years scaling teams and high-traffic systems across
		Southeast Asia and Latin America.
	</p>

	<header class="cv-print-head">
		<h1 class="cv-print-name">Jose Barbosa</h1>
		<p class="cv-print-title">Director of Engineering</p>
		<div class="cv-print-contact">
			<p>São Paulo, BR &nbsp;&nbsp; Bangkok, TH</p>
			<p>
				<a href="mailto:kidchenko@gmail.com">kidchenko@gmail.com</a>
				&nbsp;&nbsp;
				<a href="https://github.com/kidchenko" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
					>github.com/kidchenko</a
				>
				&nbsp;&nbsp;
				<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/kidchenko" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
					>linkedin.com/in/kidchenko</a
				>
			</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<div class="print:hidden">
		<section class="cv-section">
			<div class="cv-label">Contact</div>
			<div class="space-y-1">
				<p>São Paulo, BR / Bangkok, TH</p>
				<p>
					<a href="mailto:kidchenko@gmail.com">kidchenko@gmail.com</a>
				</p>
				<p>
					<a href="https://github.com/kidchenko" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
						>github.com/kidchenko</a
					>
				</p>
				<p>
					<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/kidchenko" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"
						>linkedin.com/in/kidchenko</a
					>
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />
	</div>

	<section class="cv-section">
		<div class="cv-label">Summary</div>
		<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
			<p>
				Engineering leader with <strong>15+ years</strong> scaling teams and high-traffic
				systems across Southeast Asia and Latin America. Promoted within a year from
				Head of Backend to Head of Engineering at Seven Peaks Software, scaling the
				department from <strong>30 to 60 engineers across 27+ nationalities</strong> (4
				principals, 12 tech leads) while owning <strong>$3M+ annual P&amp;L</strong>.
				Hired 20+ engineers across Thailand and abroad, redesigned the interview
				process, and halved quarterly attrition over the tenure.
			</p>
			<p>
				At Thoughtworks, led technical strategy for 50+ engineers across 9 squads
				serving a leading Australian airline, and delivered a real-time
				<strong>1.5TB</strong> Kafka migration pipeline with built-in PII compliance.
				Earlier scaled a global travel platform from <strong>5M to 20M+ daily requests</strong
				>. Today: founder of two AI-augmented B2B SaaS products, enterprise AI training
				partner across APAC and Brazil (clients include EGAT), and 7-year organizer of
				.NET Conf Thailand.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />

	<section>
		<h2 class="title mb-8 text-xl">Work history</h2>
		<div class="divide-y divide-global-text/10 border-y border-global-text/10">
			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">12/2025 - Current</div>
					<div class="text-muted">Brazil</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Founder & Technical Consultant</h3>
					<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
						<p>
							After scaling Seven Peaks Software's engineering department, transitioned to
							full-time founder and technical consultant. Building two AI-augmented B2B
							SaaS products: <strong>Vera</strong> (AI-driven company data enrichment
							platform) and <strong>.NET SaaS</strong> (AI boilerplate generator for .NET
							developers).
						</p>
						<p>
							Running end-to-end product operations - B2B sales, customer support,
							marketing - via AI automation pipelines. Delivering AI and automation
							training (n8n, LLM workflows) for SMBs in Brazil. Technical consulting on
							backend architecture, AI integration, and system audits. Working on
							open-source projects and community.
						</p>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-stack">
						AI, LLMs, n8n, SaaS, B2B Sales, .NET, Node.js, Product Operations
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">08/2022 - 12/2025</div>
					<div class="text-muted">Bangkok, Thailand</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Seven Peaks Software</h3>
					<p class="cv-role">Head of Backend Engineering, Head of Engineering</p>
					<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
						<p>
							<strong>Head of Backend.</strong> Joined to structure the backend department.
							Mapped strengths, weaknesses, and operational gaps in the first 90 days.
							Established weekly knowledge-sharing sessions, bi-monthly technical workshops
							(DDD, OWASP, AI, Performance), monthly team newsletters, and four governance
							teams (Onboarding, Process & Practices, Recruitment, Community & Mastery).
							The workshop program evolved into a revenue-generating product, delivering
							paid AI training to enterprise clients including EGAT.
						</p>
						<p>
							<strong>Head of Engineering.</strong> Promoted within a year, unifying backend,
							web, and mobile under one department, managing 4 principals and 12 tech
							leads, scaling from 30 to 60 engineers across 27+ nationalities, with
							distributed teams in India and Eastern Europe. Owned $3M+ annual P&amp;L.
						</p>
						<p>
							Hired 20+ engineers across Thailand and abroad and redesigned the interview
							process to improve hiring quality and speed at scale. Maintained bi-weekly
							1:1s with 12 direct reports and quarterly 1:1s with every engineer in the
							department, driving retention initiatives that halved quarterly attrition
							over the tenure.
						</p>
						<p>
							Created the Leader Development Program (LDP) to develop tech leads. Led
							three full appraisal cycles using a custom-built tool to pull data and
							metrics about the engineering team. Delivered internal automation, saving
							600K+ THB/year in operational and cloud costs.
						</p>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-stack">
						Enterprise AI Training, Team Scaling, P&L Management, Distributed Teams,
						Engineering Culture, Azure, AWS
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">01/2020 - 08/2022</div>
					<div class="text-muted">Bangkok, Thailand</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Thoughtworks</h3>
					<p class="cv-role">Senior Software Engineer, Tech Lead, Principal Engineer</p>
					<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
						<p>
							Led technical strategy and delivery for a 50+ person account across 9 squads,
							developing an omnichannel API for a leading Australian airline. Owned
							architecture, testing strategy, and the full development lifecycle.
						</p>
						<p>
							Designed and delivered a real-time data migration pipeline processing
							<strong>1.5TB+</strong> using Kafka, with built-in reconciliation and PII compliance
							for sensitive government data. Performance partner for 2 engineers, providing
							ongoing mentoring and career development. Recognized as senior leadership
							both by the client and within Thoughtworks.
						</p>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-stack">
						.NET, AWS, Kafka, Distributed Systems, Data Migration, PII Compliance,
						Architecture, Mentoring
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">01/2019 - 09/2023</div>
					<div class="text-muted">Nonthaburi, Thailand <span class="text-xs">(side venture)</span></div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Isho Group</h3>
					<p class="cv-role">CEO and Founder</p>
					<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
						<p>
							Founded and registered an independent company in Thailand while employed
							full-time. Built and operated a small mining operation, achieving 2x return
							on operational costs through procurement, energy, and supply-chain
							optimization.
						</p>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-stack">Operations, Cost Optimization, International Supply Chain</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">12/2017 - 12/2019</div>
					<div class="text-muted">Bangkok, Thailand</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Jetabroad</h3>
					<p class="cv-role">Senior Software Engineer, Lead Software Engineer</p>
					<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
						<p>
							First international role. Scaled platform from <strong
								>5M to 20M daily requests</strong
							>, growing infrastructure from 20 to 100 AWS instances. Optimized GDS query
							logging to consolidate redundant API calls, reducing AWS costs by ~$2K+/month.
							Built data pipelines for business reporting. Owned bi-weekly release cycles
							with A/B testing.
						</p>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-stack">
						.NET, AWS, High-Scale Systems, Performance Optimization, Cost Reduction, Data
						Pipelines
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">2010 - 2017</div>
					<div class="text-muted">São Paulo, Brazil</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Earlier career</h3>
					<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
						<p>
							<strong>Lambda3.</strong> Mid-Engineer, Senior Engineer, Lead Software Engineer
							/ DevOps Consultant.
						</p>
						<p>
							<strong>Germinadora.</strong> Founded two startups - Rose (Imagine Cup finalist,
							$100K+ raised) and Unline ($15K seed).
						</p>
						<p><strong>Arcnet.</strong> Software Engineer / Scrum Master.</p>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-stack">
						C#, JavaScript, Azure, Docker, CI/CD, Scrum, DevOps, Microservices, Startups
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />

	<section>
		<h2 class="title mb-8 text-xl">Education</h2>
		<div class="divide-y divide-global-text/10 border-y border-global-text/10">
			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">2010 - 2013</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">Salvador Arena Foundation Educational Center</h3>
					<p class="cv-role">Bachelor in Systems Analysis and Development</p>
				</div>
			</article>
			<article class="cv-job">
				<div class="cv-meta">
					<div class="font-bold">2008 - 2009</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="cv-job-title">ETEC Jorge Street</h3>
					<p class="cv-role">Vocational Diploma in Mechatronics and Electronics</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />

	<section>
		<h2 class="title mb-8 text-xl">Skills</h2>
		<div class="space-y-8">
			<div class="cv-skills-row">
				<h3 class="cv-skills-label">Leadership & people</h3>
				<p>
					Team scaling (30 to 60 across 27+ nationalities); distributed teams (India,
					Eastern Europe); 1:1 programs at scale (bi-weekly with reports, quarterly with
					every engineer); performance reviews & appraisal cycles; coaching & mentoring;
					Leader Development Programs; OKRs; engineering culture.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cv-skills-row">
				<h3 class="cv-skills-label">Strategy & vision</h3>
				<p>
					Technical strategy & engineering roadmaps; engineering org design; architecture
					decision-making; build-vs-buy evaluation; multi-year planning; executive &
					stakeholder reporting; data-driven engineering decisions.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cv-skills-row">
				<h3 class="cv-skills-label">Engineering excellence</h3>
				<p>
					Governance programs (process, recruitment, onboarding, community);
					knowledge-sharing & technical workshop programs; engineering metrics tooling;
					quality & code-review practices; security & compliance (OWASP, PII); technical
					due diligence & system audits.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cv-skills-row">
				<h3 class="cv-skills-label">Operations & business</h3>
				<p>
					P&L management ($3M+ annual); budgeting & capacity planning; revenue
					forecasting; vendor & cost optimization; risk management; stakeholder
					management; hiring at scale; public speaking.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cv-skills-row">
				<h3 class="cv-skills-label">AI & automation</h3>
				<p>
					Enterprise AI workshop design & delivery; LLM-augmented product development; AI
					automation across sales, marketing, and support; n8n workflow automation;
					engineering team AI enablement; AI-driven SaaS operations.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cv-skills-row">
				<h3 class="cv-skills-label">Technical</h3>
				<p>
					.NET, Node.js, TypeScript, Python, AWS, Azure, Kafka, Kubernetes,
					microservices, distributed systems.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />

	<section class="cv-section">
		<div class="cv-label">Community & speaking</div>
		<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
			<p>
				Co-organizer and speaker at <strong>.NET Conf Thailand</strong> since 2018 (7 years)
				- the largest .NET conference in Thailand, ~200 attendees annually, supported by
				Microsoft. Grew the conference team from 3 to 7. Organizer of
				<strong>.NET Bangkok Meetup</strong>. Speaker at technical events across Latin
				America and Southeast Asia. <strong>Microsoft Imagine Cup Finalist</strong>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />

	<section class="cv-section">
		<div class="cv-label">Continuous learning</div>
		<div class="prose prose-cactus max-w-none">
			<p>
				<strong>100+ courses</strong> completed across distributed systems, cloud architecture,
				DDD, DevSecOps, and Kubernetes. AWS Partner Training. <strong>PSD</strong> (Professional
				Scrum Developer) certified.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<hr class="border-global-text/10 my-12" />

	<section class="cv-section">
		<div class="cv-label">Languages</div>
		<div>
			<p>Portuguese (Native), English (Fluent), Spanish (Basic), Thai (Basic).</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
	.cv-section {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.cv-section {
			grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
	.cv-label {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cv-job {
		padding-top: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.cv-job {
			grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
			padding-top: 2.5rem;
			padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
		}
	}
	.cv-meta {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.025em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cv-job-title {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.cv-job-title {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
		}
	}
	.cv-role {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.cv-stack {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.025em;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}
	.cv-skills-row {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.cv-skills-row {
			grid-template-columns: 12rem 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
	.cv-skills-label {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	/* Centered name + title + contact header - PRINT ONLY */
	.cv-print-head {
		display: none;
	}

	@media print {
		.cv-job,
		.cv-section,
		.cv-skills-row {
			page-break-inside: avoid;
		}
		hr {
			display: none;
		}

		/* Show print header with serif styling */
		.cv-print-head {
			display: block;
			text-align: center;
			padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
			margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		}
		.cv-print-name {
			font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
			font-size: 2.25rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: -0.01em;
			margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
		}
		.cv-print-title {
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.18em;
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			color: #666;
			margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
		}
		.cv-print-contact {
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}
		.cv-print-contact p {
			margin: 0.15rem 0;
		}
		.cv-print-contact a {
			color: #666;
			text-decoration: none;
		}

		/* Hide screen-only elements in print */
		.cv-screen-only {
			display: none !important;
		}

		/* Body for print */
		body {
			font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif !important;
			font-size: 0.92rem;
			line-height: 1.55;
			padding: 0 !important;
			max-width: none !important;
			color: #222;
		}

		/* Section headings (h2) */
		h2.title {
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.12em;
			font-size: 0.85rem !important;
			color: var(--color-accent);
			border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
			padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
			margin-top: 1.5rem !important;
			margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;
			font-family: inherit;
		}

		/* Restructure cv-section to single column (no left label column) */
		.cv-section {
			display: block !important;
			grid-template-columns: none !important;
			gap: 0 !important;
			margin-bottom: 1rem;
		}
		.cv-label {
			display: none !important;
		}

		/* cv-job: dates float right, title and content full width */
		.cv-job {
			display: block !important;
			grid-template-columns: none !important;
			padding: 0.85rem 0 !important;
			gap: 0 !important;
			border-bottom: none !important;
		}
		.cv-meta {
			float: right;
			text-align: right;
			margin-left: 1rem;
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			text-transform: none;
			letter-spacing: 0;
		}
		.cv-meta > .font-bold {
			font-weight: 600;
		}
		.cv-meta > .text-muted {
			font-size: 0.78rem;
			color: #777;
		}
		.cv-job-title {
			font-size: 1.05rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
		}
		.cv-role {
			color: #666;
			font-style: italic;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
		}
		.cv-stack {
			clear: both;
			font-style: italic;
			font-size: 0.78rem;
			color: #777;
			margin-top: 0.5rem;
			letter-spacing: 0;
			text-transform: none;
		}

		/* cv-skills-row: label inline, full width content */
		.cv-skills-row {
			display: block !important;
			grid-template-columns: none !important;
			gap: 0 !important;
			margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
		}
		.cv-skills-label {
			display: inline-block !important;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.05em;
			font-size: 0.78rem;
			color: var(--color-accent);
			margin-right: 0.5rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
		}
		.cv-skills-row p {
			display: block;
			margin: 0;
		}

		/* Strip dividers between articles */
		.divide-y > * + *,
		.border-y {
			border: none !important;
		}

		/* Links: subdue color, no underline */
		a {
			color: inherit !important;
			text-decoration: none !important;
		}

		/* Prose adjustments */
		.prose p {
			margin: 0.45rem 0 !important;
		}

		@page {
			margin: 1.5cm 1.5cm;
		}
	}
</style>

<style is:global>
	@media print {
		#main-header,
		body > footer {
			display: none !important;
		}
		body {
			padding-top: 0 !important;
			max-width: none !important;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	const printBtn = document.getElementById("print-cv");
	printBtn?.addEventListener("click", () => window.print());
</script>
